# Ciudad Ambar (C5a, contract 47), 34 x 24. column = i, row = j. Ruta 15 arrives at the EAST edge (i = 33, rows 12..13). Look (the user's mock "Ciudad Ambar"): a WARM seaside town at the edge of the
# savanna: the same BIG light slabs as Bruma's (`oflag_<i%2><j%2>`, never small tiles) under PALMS, animated street lamps, benches and flowerbeds, and its own touch: the Reserva's WOODEN ARCH (the gate of the
# Salvaje reserve, north-east): in C5b the arch is the ENTRANCE (walk under it: the gate house `puerta_reserva`; the guard is gone), the WEST edge (0,12..13) leads to Ruta 18 and the SOUTH edge (16..17,23) to the beach and the sea.
# The Centro (door (11,4), the Planeador lands in front of it: @fly slot 7), the tienda (door (18,4): the Ultra Cristal), the Caña buena house (door (5,4)), the Warden's house (door (23,4): he lost his golden teeth)
# and Kai's poison gym (the dojo, door (25,14)). Three townsfolk.
@map ciudad_ambar
@size 34 24
@interior no
@area ciudad_ambar
@fly 7 ciudad_ambar 11 5 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 7 = visited flag 991 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fill oflag_00
@spawn east 32 12 W
@spawn centro_door 11 5 S
@spawn tienda_door 18 5 S
@spawn cana_door 5 5 S
@spawn guardian_door 23 5 S
@spawn gym_door 25 15 S
@spawn west 1 12 E
@spawn reserva_door 27 2 S
@spawn beach 16 22 N
@legend
